From: Brad Nicholas <70774+bradn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 18:54:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Raise the reading-measure cap; follow it in Quick Look

Local patch on upstream 9be0680 (v1.0.16 + main). The "Measure
(characters)" setting may exceed 72; ReadingMeasure (68...1000) holds the
bounds, the container honours the setting at every width, and Quick Look
reads the measure through the shared preferences domain. Also fixes
install.sh's undefined STAGED_APP.

See WIDTH-PATCH-HANDOFF.md for the full list and how to reapply it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
